{"id":"630597","name":"香煎豌豆粉","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/630597/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"豌豆面","amount":"100g"}],"sub":[{"name":"水","amount":"400g"},{"name":"芝麻酱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"2瓣"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"豌豆粉小火炒香。","img":"images/630597/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"晾凉过筛。","img":"images/630597/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加200g水拌匀。","img":"images/630597/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"锅内放200g清水烧开，把豌豆粉糊缓缓倒入。","img":"images/630597/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌成粘稠糊状。","img":"images/630597/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"倒入模具放冰箱冷藏4小时以上。","img":"images/630597/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取出。","img":"images/630597/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"切块。","img":"images/630597/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"粘玉米粉。","img":"images/630597/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"下锅煎至两面金黄。","img":"images/630597/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"芝麻酱加水加盐调匀，加老抽蒜泥。","img":"images/630597/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/630597/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"淋在煎好的豌豆粉上，一起吃饭吧！","img":"images/630597/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}